r; each prefix must match a task. runTotalTokens replaces the run token limit. autoCompact true makes the runner send no /compact: it records the automatic compactions of the host and asks the probes of a stage after one. autoCompactWindow (at least 100000) sets CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW for the runs of the suite; without it the runner removes that variable and CLAUDE_AUTOCOMPACT_PCT_OVERRIDE from every run.",
